  "a": "relaxed: atomicity only, no ordering. release (store): earlier writes become visible to a thread that acquires the same variable. acquire (load): later reads see those writes. seq_cst: acquire/release plus a single global order of all seq_cst ops (default, strongest, a bit slower)."
